    "scr_dup": "002",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>如果你需要請假，請按照學校規定請假。</div>\n\n<div>遲到、早退10分鐘以上算缺課。</div>\n\n<div>平時考缺考就是0分</div>\n\n<div>作弊、抄襲 就是0分</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>If you need to ask for leave, please follow the school regulations.<br />\nBeing late or leaving early for more than 10 minutes will be counted as absence.<br />\nIf you miss an exam, you get 0 points<br />\nCheating, plagiarism is 0 points</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "請準時來上課、交作業。記得準備考試。\n如果有問題，請直接問老師。\nPlease come to class and hand in homework on time. Remember to prepare for the exam.\nIf you have questions, please ask the teacher directly.",
    "course_pol_en": "請準時來上課、交作業。記得準備考試。\n如果有問題，請直接問老師。\nPlease come to class and hand in homework on time. Remember to prepare for the exam.\nIf you have questions, please ask the teacher directly.",
    "course_rem": "上課會用到手機或平板進行活動，記得帶手機或平板。\n雖然隨堂測驗有點多，但是希望大家的華語能快速進步，請大家加油！\n\nMobile phones or tablets will be used for activities in class, remember to bring your mobile phone or tablet.\nAlthough there are a lot of quizzes in class, I hope everyone can improve their Chinese quickly. Please work hard!",
    "course_rem_en": "上課會用到手機或平板進行活動，記得帶手機或平板。\n雖然隨堂測驗有點多，但是希望大家的華語能快速進步，請大家加油！\n\nMobile phones or tablets will be used for activities in class, remember to bring your mobile phone or tablet.\nAlthough there are a lot of quizzes in class, I hope everyone can improve your Chinese quickly. Please work hard!",
    "ais_meno": "<div>請同學認真參與，如果有不認真或作弊、抄襲，老師會扣學習分數</div>\n\n<div>Students are requested to participate seriously. If there is no seriousness or cheating or plagiarism, the teacher will deduct the study marks</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>\n<div>請同學認真參與，如果有不認真或作弊、抄襲，老師會扣學習分數<br />\nStudents are requested to participate seriously. If there is no seriousness or cheating or plagiarism, the teacher will deduct the study marks</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
